title: XenServer / XCP-ng: License
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check shows the license edition of a XenServer host and monitors the
 remaining time until the license expires (default levels 30/14 days, {CRIT}
 when expired). Hosts without expiry (e.g. XCP-ng) are {OK}. Data comes from
 the special agent {agent_xenserver}.

discovery:
 One service {XenServer License} per host.
